---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config/site';
---

<Layout title="Affiliate & Editorial Disclosure | OraeSkin">
    <Header />
    <main style="padding-top: 130px; padding-bottom: 90px;">
        <article class="container disclosure-article">
            <header class="disclosure-header">
                <span class="eyebrow">Transparency & Trust</span>
                <h1>Affiliate & Editorial Disclosure</h1>
                <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: September 2026</p>
            </header>

            <div class="disclosure-body">
                <div class="highlight-callout">
                    <strong>Official Amazon Associates Statement:</strong>
                    <p>
                        "OraeSkin (www.oraeskin.in) is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program and Amazon Associates India Programme, affiliate advertising programs designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees and commissions by advertising and linking to Amazon.in and affiliated Amazon sites."
                    </p>
                </div>

                <h2>1. How Affiliate Links Work on OraeSkin</h2>
                <p>
                    Throughout our website, you will find product reviews, curated buying guides, and comparison tables. Many of the product links point to <strong>Amazon.in</strong> with our associate tag (<code>{SITE_CONFIG.amazon.tag}</code>).
                </p>
                <p>
                    When you click on these links and make a purchase, Amazon pays us a small referral commission. 
                    <strong>This happens at zero additional cost to you.</strong> The price you pay on Amazon India is identical whether you use our link or navigate to Amazon directly.
                </p>

                <h2 id="editorial">2. Our Editorial Independence & Review Process</h2>
                <p>
                    Our editorial integrity is our top priority. Our recommendations, product scores, pros & cons, and buying guides are created independently based on:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Ingredient efficacy</strong>: Active concentrations, non-comedogenic formulations, and suitability for Indian melanin-rich skin.</li>
                    <li><strong>Weather performance</strong>: How products perform in Indian heat, high humidity, and urban air pollution.</li>
                    <li><strong>Real customer verification</strong>: Analyzing hundreds of verified Indian customer reviews on Amazon India to weed out formulations that cause breakouts or white cast.</li>
                    <li><strong>Value for money</strong>: Ensuring budget-friendly picks (under ₹500) stand up against luxury alternatives.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    We never accept payment or incentives from brands in exchange for a positive review. If a product fails to meet our standards, we clearly highlight its shortcomings in our "Keep in Mind" sections.
                </p>

                <h2>3. Medical & Dermatological Disclaimer</h2>
                <p>
                    The content on OraeSkin is provided for educational and informational purposes only. It is not intended as medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. 
                    Always consult a certified dermatologist or healthcare provider before introducing new active ingredients (such as high-strength Retinoids, BHAs, or AHAs) into your routine, especially if you have sensitive skin, rosacea, or are pregnant.
                </p>

                <h2>4. Questions or Concerns?</h2>
                <p>
                    If you have questions regarding our affiliate partnerships, review methodology, or suggestions for products we should review next, please feel free to reach out via our social channels or contact page.
                </p>
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
    .disclosure-article {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .disclosure-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #c87a54;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .disclosure-header h1 {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 2.6rem;
        color: #2c2c2c;
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    }

    .last-updated {
        color: #888;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .disclosure-body {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #3e3e3e;
    }

    .disclosure-body h2 {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: #2c2c2c;
        margin-top: 36px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .highlight-callout {
        background: #fdfaf6;
        border-left: 4px solid #c87a54;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .highlight-callout strong {
        color: #c87a54;
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .highlight-callout p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #4a4a4a;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .disclosure-body ul {
        padding-left: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .disclosure-body li {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .disclosure-header h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
    }
</style>
